meta {
  name: getUsageByUser
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

get {
  url: {{registry}}/api/v1/protected/projects/acme/web/usage?by=user
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Per-user storage attribution: the project's usage split across the distinct
  pushers of each blob (size/N per HAS_PUSHED.user). Response:
  { "usages": { "alice": 250, "bob": 250, "unknown": <unattributed> },
    "quota_bytes": <quota> }. The "unknown" bucket holds bytes with no
  attributable pusher (compute-generated/legacy); Sum(usages) == usage_bytes.
  Admin-only.
}
